@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

box Logic LOGIC_COLOR_T1
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ClientBookParser" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":TagCommandParser" as TagParser LOGIC_COLOR
participant "command:TagCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
end box

box Model MODEL_COLOR_T1
participant "model:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "original:Person" as Person MODEL_COLOR
end box

box Storage STORAGE_COLOR_T1
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR
end box

[-> Logic : execute("tag 1 priority referral")
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(commandText)
activate Parser
Parser -> TagParser : parse(arguments)
activate TagParser
note right of TagParser
Parse the displayed-list index and validate one or more tags.
The parsed set removes duplicate supplied tags.
end note
create Command
TagParser -> Command : new TagCommand(index, tags)
TagParser --> Parser : command
deactivate TagParser
Parser --> Logic : command
deactivate Parser
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
Model --> Command : displayedPersons
note right of Command : Reject an out-of-range index before changing data.
Command -> Person : getTags()
Person --> Command : existingTags
note right of Command
Intersect existingTags with supplied tags.
Case-insensitive Tag equality detects repeats.
end note
alt at least one supplied tag already exists
    Command --> Logic : CommandException listing duplicate tags
    deactivate Command
    [<-- Logic : error message
else all supplied tags are new
Command -> Command : union existingTags with supplied tags
Command -> Person : withTags(updatedTags)
Person --> Command : updatedPerson
Command -> Model : setPerson(original, updatedPerson)
note right of Model
Replace the immutable Person while preserving all other fields.
The observable list updates the PersonCard and retains its active filter.
end note
Command --> Logic : CommandResult
deactivate Command
Logic -> Model : getClientBook()
Model --> Logic : clientBook
Logic -> Storage : saveClientBook(clientBook)
Storage --> Logic
[<-- Logic : CommandResult
end
deactivate Logic
@enduml
